ll_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuzudb/kuzu/zipball/v0.11.3","body":"Kuzu v0.11.3 is a minor release that bundles the Kuzu v0.11.2 release with four extensions: \r\n  - algo\r\n  - fts\r\n  - json\r\n  - vector\r\n\r\nThis ensures that you do not have to `INSTALL` these extensions when using v0.11.3.\r\n\r\nTo use extensions with any prior release of Kuzu or to use other extensions with v0.11.3, you need to set up a local extension server. The instructions of setting up a local extension server can be found [here](https://kuzudb.github.io/docs/extensions/#host-your-own-extension-server). \r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Improve static link extension error message by @acquamarin in https://github.com/kuzudb/kuzu/pull/6035\r\n* Rust static extensions by @benjaminwinger in https://github.com/kuzudb/kuzu/pull/6043\r\n* Rust static extensions fix by @benjaminwinger in https://github.com/kuzudb/kuzu/pull/6044\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kuzudb/kuzu/compare/v0.11.2...v0.11.3","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuzudb/kuzu/releases/253658601/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":2}